= The Canton Coup

Li Zhilong, member of the CPC had sent the warships *Yongfeng* (renamed Zhongshan in Sun Yat-sen's honor) and *Baobi* back to Guangzhou to rescue a foreign ship attacked by bandits.

Upon reaching Huangpu (Whampoa), Deng Yanda, Whampoa's director of education reportedly did not know about this. 

On March 19th, Li Zhilong then telegrammed Chiang Kai-shek to let the warships in since a Soviet advisor wanted to visit. Rumors then spread that Li Zhilong wanted Chiang Kai-shek kidnapped and sent into Vladivostok.

Chiang, arriving back to Guangzhou the next day, immediately declared martial law to stop "a coup led by the CPC and the Soviet Union under Nikolai Kuybyshev". Under orders sent to Ouyang Ge and Chen Zhaoying, the Zhongshan Warship was occupied, Li Zhilong detained and multiple CPC members arrested.

What happens now?
